{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん\nこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鈴木絢音です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から個人ブログを始めさせていただくことになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまでの研究生ブログ同様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私らしく丁寧なブログにしていきたいと思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が感じた事を素直に綴っていきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このブログがたくさんの方と繋がる場所になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ayane.suzuki/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ayane.suzuki/img/2015/02/01/4631748/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鈴木絢音"}],"source":"archive"}